One-shot 3 s trick: right foot lifts and bangs down twice, head yaw left then right,
ends standing; all-zero 13-D command, no clock in the obs (happy-hop contract).
Template = ball kick (Rémi: not flamingo). groundcontact model, BAM with delay DR 0-9.
Time-window-gated rewards, impact rewarded but capped (stomp, not slam), foot overspeed
and trunk |a_z| taxed. Spec, cfg tests (13), local Warp smoke OK (19 terms, no NaN).
